    <briefdescription>
<para>Distributed token blacklist with TCP cluster synchronization. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Provides DistributedTokenBlacklist implementing ITokenBlacklist via a peer-to-peer TBLK/v1 RPC protocol. Nodes gossip revocations so that every replica reaches eventual consistency within the configured TTL. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
